[gd_resource type="StandardMaterial3D" format=3]

; Ironjaw's skin. Deep warm brown-grey - roughly half the value of Kestrel's
; tan, which is the single biggest reason the two fighters never get confused
; at a glance even when both are in silhouette.
;
; Lower roughness than the player: this one reads as sweat-sheened, and the
; specular pop is what keeps the darker skin from going muddy under the
; stage spots.

